Qoder CN check-in follows the official Qoder CN desktop campaign API:

  GET  https://openapi.qoder.com.cn/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns
  POST https://openapi.qoder.com.cn/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns/{campaignId}/claim

Observed from Qoder CN 0.3.4 (activity iframe
https://g.alicdn.com/qbase/qoder/0.0.704/growth-page/activity-iframe/activity-iframe.js).
The worker reuses the pinned AuthManager and does not copy Qoder's campaign UI.
